{"id":"DRKS00017089","src":"drks","title":"German HIT-LOGGIC-Registry, Prospective multicenter registry for children and adolescents with low-grade glioma","official":"","summary":"Prospective collection of clinical data and their combination with biological and molecular data  (LOGGIC Core) of pediatric patients with LGG. Therapeutic interventions are not planned and in case of indication are carried out within separate clinical trials and/or along the recommendations of the SIOP-E working group for LGG in children and adolescents","conditions":["Brain, supratentorial","Cerebrum, except lobes and ventricles","Spinal cord","Brain, infratentorial","Brain, unspecified","Cranial nerves","Other specified parts of central nervous system","Central nervous system, unspecified"],"interventions":[{"type":"ARM","name":"Cliinical patient data are recorded. These will be linked with biological and molecular data of the tumors from the LOGGIC Bioclinical Databank"}],"criteria":"Inclusion criteria:\nDiagnosis of LGG by neuropathology or neuroradiology as approved by the pertinent reference Centers, Age from birth to 21 years, signed informed consent by patients and parents\nExclusion criteria:\nDiagnosis of a different brain tumor","minAge":"","maxAge":"21 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":null,"start":"2019-01-01","pcd":"","upd":"2026-01-13","sponsor":"Charité - Universitätsmedizin Berlin","areas":["neurology","oncology"],"central":["PD Dr. Pablo Hernáiz Driever · Charité - Universitätsmedizin Berlin · 030-450666829 · pablo.hernaiz@charite.de"],"sites":[{"f":"Charité-Universitätsmedizin Berlin","city":"Berlin","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":52.5244,"lon":13.4105},{"f":"Vestische Kinder- u. Jugendklinik Datteln","city":"Datteln","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":51.656,"lon":7.3453},{"f":"Universitätsmedizin Greifswald","city":"Greifswald","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":54.0891,"lon":13.4024},{"f":"Charité-U